-- Which update runs follows `mode`: playTicks while mode is "play", otherTicks once
-- the space key flips it (frame 2). Six frames of draw ops must agree across engines.
mode is "play"
playTicks is 0
otherTicks is 0
when "space" is pressed
  mode is "over"
to update play
  playTicks is playTicks + 1
to update
  otherTicks is otherTicks + 1
to draw
  clear screen to black
  write "{playTicks}-{otherTicks}" at 2, 2 in white on hud
run game with update and draw
